        <p>I will not do work that is unlawful, such as getting into accounts or devices that are not yours, bypassing security you are not authorized to bypass, or installing pirated software. If I come across illegal content while working, especially content involving the exploitation of children, I may stop work and report it to the authorities where the law requires or allows it.</p>
